00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:13.790
ERIC SCHMIDT: Hi.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:14.498
I'm Eric Schmidt.

00:00:14.498 --> 00:00:17.120
I'm a Developer Advocate in
