00:00:20.826 --> 00:00:21.950
SAPTARSHI MUKHERJEE: Great.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.660
And we're going to
talk about love.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.140
What's a better day than the
day before Valentine's Day

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.607
